    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2023-competency-07: resolvable-now, resolvability 0.87";
    dc:description "The rise and plateau are direct simulation outputs, and the drift explanation can be tested with replicated trajectories and altered tie-breaking. Public methods are adequate for reimplementation.";
