    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Evolve the competency gene from 1-15 for 1000 generations over many seeds and measure trajectories, stable values, and the minimum competency needed for maximal fitness. Test whether neutral drift among equally fit high values explains the plateau.";
