    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "A single trajectory cannot establish a typical plateau.", "Tie-breaking and mutation rules can shift neutral-drift outcomes.";
